%% HAND-CURATED. Per sys-03 §11.1 + §4.3 — supervisor task (priority 24) is only task that may force controlled reboot.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Device
    participant SafetySupervisor
    participant ConfigService

    Note over Device,SafetySupervisor: ANY STATE — crash/thermal/heap/peripheral failure detected
    SafetySupervisor->>SafetySupervisor: classify fault severity (info | warning | critical)
    alt reboot_storm (E-BOT-801, boot_fail_window >= 3 in 15min)
        SafetySupervisor->>Device: skip normal startup at next boot, display support code
    else thermal_critical (E-THM-601)
        SafetySupervisor->>Device: stop motion and audio amp boost, monitor temperature
    else heap_below_floor (E-MEM-701)
        SafetySupervisor->>Device: disable non-essential render, controlled reboot if unrecovered
    else audio_overrun_repeated (E-AUD-102, 5 in 10min)
        SafetySupervisor->>Device: increment counter — 3 occurrences in one boot → SAFE_MODE
    else watchdog_near_miss_persistent
        SafetySupervisor->>Device: restart capture pipeline — reboot after 3 consecutive
    end

    SafetySupervisor->>Device: transition state=SAFE_MODE — set safe_mode_until NVS marker
    Device->>Device: display support scene with short error token
    Device->>Device: allow only heartbeat and diagnostics and config pull (no realtime, no wake)

    Device->>ConfigService: POST /v1/devices/heartbeat {runtime.state="SAFE_MODE", faults.lastFaultCode}
    ConfigService-->>Device: 204
    Note over ConfigService: cloud fleet alerts fire if safe-mode entry rate > 1% over 30min

    loop job_safe_mode_exit_check every 10min
        Device->>Device: re-evaluate health (heap recovered, thermal cleared, no fault burst)
        alt remote_recovery_or_reboot
            Device->>Device: clear safe_mode_until, reboot → state=BOOTING
        else stay
            Device->>Device: remain SAFE_MODE, emit telemetry
        end
    end

    Note over Device,ConfigService: only safety supervisor may force controlled reboot · support bundle assembled without raw audio
